            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "CSB Bancorp (CSBB): Net Profit Margin Rise Reinforces Narrative of Durable Profitability",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "CSB Bancorp (CSBB) delivered a 9.2% jump in earnings over the past year, outpacing its five-year compound annual growth rate of 3.1%. The bank\u2019s net profit margin ticked higher to 30.6% from 30.2%, reflecting a subtle improvement in profitability, while the quality of its earnings remains strong. Trading at a 10.7x Price-To-Earnings ratio, which is lower than the US Banks industry average but slightly above immediate peers, CSBB also sits below its DCF-derived fair value, with no risk...",
